["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/hasDeclaredLicense", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Artifact was discovered to actually contain each `to` /SimpleLicensing/AnyLicenseInfo (for example, as detected by automated tooling).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/HashAlgorithm/adler32", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Adler-32 checksum is part of the widely used zlib compression library as defined in [RFC 1950](https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc1950/) Section 2.3.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
